<Episode>
<Section type="report" startTime="0" endTime="211.950">
<Turn startTime="0" endTime="26.47" speaker="spk1">
<Sync time="0"/>
A:xka:n ne:, nikneki xne:chtapowi xa: tiki:xmati se: xiwit,
<Sync time="6.362"/>
kiliah aha:wi,
<Sync time="8.875"/>
ox no: tiki:xmattok n' teh.
<Sync time="11.13"/>
Ne:, ke:niwki, ne:n, ixiwyo,
<Sync time="15.184"/>
ox kowit oso komekat oso xiwit sah.
<Sync time="20.063"/>
Wa:n ixo:chio wa:n ita:kilo ke:niwki, xa: tiki:xmati toni n' kwali, toni n' kwali ika se: kichi:wa. 
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="26.47" endTime="73.31">
<Sync time="26.47"/>
Pos nejó:n mochi:wa kowke:span mahyá: komekatsí:n sah, pero, nejé:n,
<Sync time="33.425"/>
ixiwyo ma:ahalaxtik wa:n n' i...,
<Sync time="36.885"/>
ixo:chio a:mo nikmati katí:n *color** n' ixo:chiotsi:n, pero ne:n ita:kilka we:lik.
<Sync time="42.488"/>
*Cuando** selik ok nehe:n xohxoxoktik ok, *pero cuando**, nejó:n, we:lia ya, kohkostik mochi:wa.
<Sync time="50.939"/>
Wa:n se: ki..., se: kitapa:na, se: kiteki wa:n se: ki:xtapa:ntiwetsi wa:n se: kihtikopi:ntiwetsi *porque** komohkó:n ompa se: kihti..., se: kikwahtiw iihtik nehe:n te:te:nahwayo:tih n' icho:kilo.
<Sync time="61.131"/>
Entó:s se: kit..., se: kihtikopi:ntiwetsi para se: kikwa ya, kalampa ya a:mo mah se: ki..., mah a:mo ompa se: kikwahto de iihtik mah se: kikwitiw.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="73.31" endTime="75.275">
<Sync time="73.31"/>
¿Ke:yeh kiliah aha:wi?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="75.275" endTime="79.931">
<Sync time="75.275"/>
A:it, at ke:yeh, tak i:pa iwki kito:ka:ytiah sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="79.931" endTime="89.177">
<Sync time="79.931"/>
¿I:pa sayoh se: taman onkak oso onkak miak taman wa:n
<Sync time="83.851"/>
xa: seki we:lik wa:n seki a:mo we:lik, neh a:mo niki..., neh no: nikmattok pero a:mo nikmati ox onkak miak taman. 
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="89.177" endTime="98.423">
<Sync time="89.177"/>
A:mo, neh n'mattok se: taman sah n' onkak, yehwa yo:n yah..., yahya:..., yahya:wi kiliah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="98.423" endTime="101.057">
<Sync time="98.423"/>
Ne:...,
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="101.057" endTime="103.079">
<Sync time="101.057"/>
Xa: no: ke:masá: tikwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="103.079" endTime="105.847">
<Sync time="103.079"/>
Neh sepatsi:n nikwahka, pero a:mo ke:man nikwah ok,
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="105.847" endTime="107.722">
<Sync time="105.847"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
ke:man ni..., nikwahtoya ne:,
<Who nb="2"/>
Mitste:nahwayo:tih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="107.722" endTime="110.222">
<Sync time="107.722"/>
Ke:mah, ne:chte:nahwayo:tih wa:n a:mo ke:man nikwah ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="110.222" endTime="112.008">
<Sync time="110.222"/>
Ke:mah, pos ta: icho:kilo.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="112.008" endTime="114.454">
<Sync time="112.008"/>
Ke:mah, ka:n wel nik..., ka:n nikmatik ke:ní:w se: kikwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2 spk1" startTime="114.454" endTime="117.222">
<Sync time="114.454"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
A:, se kihtikopi:ntiwetsi.
<Who nb="2"/>
Yehwa ika a:mo ke:man nikwah ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="117.222" endTime="124.745">
<Sync time="117.222"/>
Ke:mah. Ne:,
<Sync time="120.012"/>
i..., i:pa nejó:n, ¿a:mo tikmati ox xa: kwaltia para pahti?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="124.745" endTime="126.834">
<Sync time="124.745"/>
A:mo.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="126.834" endTime="138.12">
<Sync time="126.834"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
I..., ihkó:n sah i:pa sayoh para se: kikwa:s.
<Who nb="2"/>
I:pa ihkó:n sah, nikita ka:mpa onkak nikteki wa:n nikwa.
<Sync time="133.241"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
¿Wa:n ka:ni, ne:n, telta:ki oso ka:ni n' onkak, ka:ni n' mochi:wa, no:yá:n sah?
<Who nb="2"/>
Kow...,
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="138.12" endTime="142.384">
<Sync time="138.12"/>
noyá:n itech kwowit mochi:wa.
<Sync time="140.799"/>
Kowke:span.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="142.384" endTime="148.603">
<Sync time="142.384"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
A:mo ta:lpantsi:n e:wa.
<Who nb="2"/>
A:mo, a:mo ta: kowke:span mahyá: komekat, ke:meh yo:n
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="148.603" endTime="157.63">
<Sync time="148.603"/>
tekxo:chima:it, iwki.
<Sync time="150.759"/>
Iwki pero yeh nejé:n ma:pa:pata:wak wa:n i:n ma:pi:pisi:ltik, a:mo semi wehwei n' ima:y. Mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="157.63" endTime="165.152">
<Sync time="157.63"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
¿Wa:n ixiwyo kikwah tapialmeh oso ...?
<Who nb="2"/>
A:mo, a:mo i..., i:pa kowke:span sah mochi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="165.152" endTime="175.148">
<Sync time="165.152"/>
Pos ka:n n'mati komo a:mo teh tikmati ok toni ne:n
<Sync time="168.518"/>
kwali se: kikwi i:n
<Sync time="170.951"/>
aha:wi n' teh tikilia, ihkó:n no: tik..., no: tikto:ka:ytia?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2 spk1" startTime="175.148" endTime="178.956">
<Sync time="175.148"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Yahya:wi nikilia, yahya:wi, Ajá neh nikilia yahya:wi.
<Who nb="2"/>
A:, n' teh tikilia yahya:wi.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="178.956" endTime="183.197">
<Sync time="178.956"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
A:, wa:n neh ne:chilihkeh *que** aha:wi. Neh nki:xmattok *que** aha:wi mono:tsa.
<Who nb="2"/>
Ajá.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="183.197" endTime="204.763">
<Sync time="183.197"/>
Ke:mah, eski ka..., a:mo teihsá:, ta:taman i:ksá: teihsá: se: kito:ka:ytia pero
<Sync time="187.126"/>
no: yehwa es n' tein neh niki:xmattok, *porque** nikmattok *que** sep..., sepa nikwa:ya wa:n ne:chte:nahwayo:tih. A:mo ke:man nikwah ok.
<Sync time="194.562"/>
Ke:mah.
<Sync time="200.254"/>
Pos pané: yehwa sah, a:xka:n xne:chili, ne:, moto:ka:y wa:n ka:ni n' tiwa:le:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="204.763" endTime="211.950">
